Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.35,0:00:04.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hi, let's take a quick look at this loan risk dashboard.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.80,0:00:12.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,We can enter a person's details, check their risk score,\Nand understand how the model arrived at the result.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.95,0:00:17.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,First, this page gives us an overview of the applicants.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.40,0:00:23.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,We can see repayment results and compare groups by income,\Neducation, and other details.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.68,0:00:28.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now, let's enter the yearly income and the loan amount.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,We can also add other loan details and the goods price, if\Nthat information is available.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.68,0:00:42.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, we fill in the age, work experience, family details,\Nand housing information.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.13,0:00:47.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Once these basic details are ready, we can move to the\Nrisk check.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.62,0:00:52.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,If we have external credit scores, we can enter them here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.05,0:00:57.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we can leave these fields blank and click\NAssess risk.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.65,0:01:03.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here, the estimated chance of default is seven point six\Npercent.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.69,0:01:08.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,The risk score is eight out of one hundred, which falls in\Nthe low risk group.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.82,0:01:14.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is only an estimate. It does not guarantee what will\Nhappen.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.97,0:01:19.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,A person still needs to review the result before making a\Nlending decision.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what is behind the prediction.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.12,0:01:30.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,This page shows the main factors used by the model, along\Nwith a breakdown for this applicant.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.05,0:01:35.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here, we compare different models using cross validation.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.50,0:01:41.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,XGBoost is selected, and we can check the comparison and\Ntuning details on this page.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.45,0:01:47.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, we check the model's test results and performance\Ncharts.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.51,0:01:52.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,These help us see how well the model works and how its\Nscores behave.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.05,0:01:57.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,The methodology page explains the formulas used in the\Ndashboard.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.82,0:02:03.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,The feature reference tells us what each input means and\Nhow missing details are handled.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.12,0:02:08.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Finally, we can check the model version and training\Ndetails.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.67,0:02:15.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,So, we can go from applicant details to a risk estimate,\Nand review the information behind it.
